        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIgHSDfYxBkEBAS426VhU6AD4w4TheodtJgTKCEOzMi7eEG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "the absolute best tattoo artist in town. whether you want a copy paste, or something designed by Sly himself- he’s got you covered! as someone with over forty tattoos and thirty-five of them are done by him- I could not recommend anyone any more than him! reasonably priced, great work, great chats and jokes, great atmosphere! 10/10 would recommend! ❤️",
        "time": 1766858917,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Duane Drover",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112887398364812175358/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIsTOTFYz1LQBahiTlsbsbnPM7qc04B8Vb1tvXwEM4V4ROp6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Sylvain Lalonde. Is the epitome of who a body (tattoo) Artist should be. I recommend him 100%. His instincts of shape, size, design, and colour is rare!! He is doing what he is meant to be doing. It’s the second time we have seen him, and I would never go to any other person. He can design my whole body!!!  Seriously!!! He is fantastic. He deserves 5 stars and I am endorsing him with all my accolades. Truly go Sylvan. If you want to do somebody body art he will not fail you I promise.",
        "time": 1768598626,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jamieson Heselton",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106102475491057347378/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6CQTonk9N-u-faeMuBOTrY2t2ccRni6_GADw2RPYi3Muw-g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Sly ! His attention to detail is outstanding. He made me feel comfortable and relaxed this guy is a pro !\nIf you’re thinking of your next or first tattoo go see him at Guilty Pleasures INK !!! I walked out of there with a smile on my face.",
        "time": 1768427716,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Elodie 04",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105717207159490219520/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWZOBMS1lnZZcxWmA3fIqlsvl0yubo2DtotieesDRC5mm2cCxfy=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Le best tattoo à Vaudreuil , I would also come here if I lived far . Best prices also he’s very reasonable. Super nice and I would recommend to anyone. 5 ⭐️ for me",
        "time": 1768585278,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Smith",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112477358862425595767/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDKlprTY299Mor69GoJHzA6CaYYWqZSjYi-JHf0Y21Zw0FkZR5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "My husband and I are first timers. Sylvain was super nice and helpful throughout the whole process. He was patient with me and my fear of needles.\nthe tattoos came out great! and beautiful.\nwe are both super impressed at how well the images came out. and he was very quick.\nhighly recommend Guilty Pleasures.",
